        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cement, unspecified, market mix, at regional storage
na;
UUID: 5a8e6078-981c-3edf-aa23-e14c099fb5ba
This data set accounts for 1 kg of cement, unspecified at the regional storage. 14% are from import, 86% are produced in Switzerland. The imported share is weighted with a factor of 1.1. The imported goods are delievered to Switzerland to 47% from Germany, 41% from Italy 9% from France, 3% from France and 1% from Denmark. 2% are delievered by freight train and 98% by lorry.; Geography: Switzerland
Location: Switzerland
Technology: undefined
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: statistical data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5a8e6078-981c-3edf-aa23-e14c099fb5ba.xml</text>
